.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "snakepit daemon config" 1  "snakepit daemon config " 
.SH NAME
snakepit daemon config \- ⚙️  Configure daemon settings
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnakepit daemon config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
⚙️  Configure daemon settings
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
snakepit daemon config\-set(1)
✏️  Set daemon configuration
.TP
snakepit daemon config\-show(1)
👀 Show current configuration
.TP
snakepit daemon config\-reset(1)
🔄 Reset to default configuration
.TP
snakepit daemon config\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
